    "text": "Tam 74 dakika bekleyip alabildim dönerimi. Döner çok farklı ve gayet lezzetli ama o kadar sıra varken sadece bir kişinin hizmet etmesi kabul edilemez. Dükkan sahibinin büyük ayıbı bu. Çalışanlar çok iyiydi. Hem samimi hem de ilgiliydiler.",
    "textTranslated": "I waited a full 74 minutes to get my döner. The döner was very different and quite delicious, but it's unacceptable that only one person was serving when there was such a long line. That's a huge mistake on the part of the shop owner. The staff were very good. They were both friendly and attentive."
